  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "经理，这个钱我取回来了，来芳芳给我装这个包里，咱给李总送过去，人家给咱介绍了个好活，咱也得懂规矩，中间人这份不能少。哎，好，李总给我打来电话了。喂，李总正准备出发去你那儿呢哦换个地方去饭店见面，是有什么安排吗？哎呀，别管那么多了，你赶紧过来吧，再晚一会儿，你连吃屎都赶不上热的了。哎，好，咋回事啊？经理理总那边应该是有什么事儿了，但是又不能明说咱们走吧，随机应变这个事儿。李总，哎呀，宋经理来来来赶紧做，哎呀，人家都是千里送鹅毛，礼轻情意重，你这是鸡毛都不带一根就跑过来了。今天要不是看在赵总的面子，你一口菜你都倒不上，往后还能不能继续占？赵总的便宜，可全看你今天的表现了啊。李总啊，那咱也不能奔着占赵总便宜去啊，咱得先做一个有用的人。不好意思啊，赵总，我这来迟了，我先来个入场酒，咋不吭声了？找我啥事儿说呀啊您上次不是给我介绍了一个好活吗？已经结束了，我来给您汇报一下工作，要不您和赵总先谈，我看烟快抽完了，我去车里拿两包烟。你别急歪了，有话赶紧的吧，都不是外人。李总啊，您能给我一个表现的机会，让我在不同的圈子里面立名，结识不同的人脉。我感激不尽，这次啊我把咱下次项目的备用金带来了，这下次的项目还没影呢。老弟，你就先站住了，今人是听天命。赵总啊，这宋经理啥都好，就是胆小重规矩，你不让他吃，他就是饿死，都不会主动伸筷子，咱给它夹个菜吧。宋老弟可以，李总先请，哎，呦呦受宠若惊啊，李总。哎呀，赵总哎呀，赵总啊，今天这个鱼吃的怎么样？不错，可以，宋经理啊跑个腿儿，把这鱼打包一份，送赵总车里去就在楼下，那李总，我送完鱼就直接回去了。今天打扰两位哥哥，雅兴海岸，下次补过。哎，去吧去吧，经理，那个鱼，我去打包吧，听不懂弦外之音呢，芳芳把后备箱内箱好酒给赵总放车上去。哦，经理，我还是不明白那个鱼，那个鱼喂，李总哦，明天晚上和赵总，哎，好好好，感谢哥哥，这到底咋回事啊？经理李总说，赵总有个项目想跟我谈约我明天晚上见面，看来今天啊是过关了。李总真是太好了，看似粗鲁，实则一直在帮我们说话。经理，你这样显得我很呆呀，到底咋回事啊？今天我把今天的话给你翻译，翻译就懂了，咱们说好的去公司找李总，再然后呢又让赶到去饭店。这八成啊是赵总有项目，李总给赵总推荐了咱，但赵总啊想眼见为实，于是啊李总临时安排了在饭店见面，就是想让赵总看看咱是怎么表现的。哦，我说怎么换地方了？然后呢，然后一见面，李总就说鸡毛都不带一根儿就跑来了，完全不是他以前那种稳重的风格。对我啊更像是关系非常好的兄弟一样口无遮拦，就是想借这种方式告诉赵总，他和咱们的关系非常近。怪不得李总今天说话这么的鸡毛。再然后呢再然后李总让我直接说这次项目的事儿，就是想让赵总看看我的表现，而且也是想告诉赵总，他自己也在跟我合作，让赵总对我放心。怪不得呢这按说这事儿都是私底下讲的。再然后呢再然后啊李总我啥都好，就是胆小重规矩，别人不说让我吃，我饿死都不会主动伸筷子。这句话的潜台词就是告诉赵总，别人给了我，就要别人不给我，绝对不会主动伸手，说明我是一个做事的人，不是爱钱的人。哇。这这么多道道啊，那那那个鱼李总给我加了一块鱼腹部的肉，这叫推心置腹。而且有了李总帮我做了这么多的铺垫，赵总呢就给我加了一颗鱼眼，这叫高看一眼。所以李总最后问赵总，今天这鱼吃着怎么样？就是想让赵总表个态，如果赵总说不好吃，那就说明赵总的项目啊，咱们没机会了。如果赵总说好吃，那李总啊就会借着让咱给赵总往车上送鱼的噱头表示一下。所以啊打包鱼是假的，表示才是真的。甲方愿意给咱机会了，作为乙方必须要表示啊。所以我让你把我车里那箱好酒给赵总送车上去了。话能听懂又能接住事儿，还能做对，那机会自然就成了，不是吗？我的天哪，这么多弦外之音，你是怎么听明白的？经理教教我呗。鸟欲高飞仙，振翅人，求上尽多读书。我给你推荐本书吧，小芳，就是这本我最近在反复看的这本书啊，教你在不同的场合下怎么审时度势，会接话，会精准表达，掌握倾听与接话的艺术。这里面啊包含了六十一种口才技巧，每一篇都是以案例加方法的形式来教我们实用的表达术。不仅能教会我，我们听懂外外音，还能教我们精准的把话说到点子上，从而啊游刃有余的应对不同的人和场合，耳才和口才都是成功的标配，是改善人际关系的一把利器。尤其是跟客户、领导、老板等高水平的人对话，一定要学会把话说到刀刃上。唯有如此啊，才能让我们得到更多的机会，见识更多的贵人，从而走向更高的位置，获得更高的财富。这些书啊，我都放在左下方链接了，快去拍吧。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00001",
      "start_ms": 330,
      "end_ms": 730,
      "text": "经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00002",
      "start_ms": 910,
      "end_ms": 2150,
      "text": "这个钱我取回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2430,
      "end_ms": 4370,
      "text": "来芳芳给我装这个包里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4410,
      "end_ms": 5450,
      "text": "咱给李总送过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5690,
      "end_ms": 7070,
      "text": "人家给咱介绍了个好活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7130,
      "end_ms": 8049,
      "text": "咱也得懂规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8129,
      "end_ms": 9250,
      "text": "中间人这份不能少。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00008",
      "start_ms": 9350,
      "end_ms": 9590,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00009",
      "start_ms": 9610,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00010",
      "start_ms": 11410,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "李总给我打来电话了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00011",
      "start_ms": 13630,
      "end_ms": 13870,
      "text": "喂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00012",
      "start_ms": 13930,
      "end_ms": 18710,
      "text": "李总正准备出发去你那儿呢哦换个地方去饭店见面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19130,
      "end_ms": 20090,
      "text": "是有什么安排吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20150,
      "end_ms": 20630,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00015",
      "start_ms": 20910,
      "end_ms": 21830,
      "text": "别管那么多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00016",
      "start_ms": 21830,
      "end_ms": 22730,
      "text": "你赶紧过来吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00017",
      "start_ms": 23410,
      "end_ms": 24210,
      "text": "再晚一会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00018",
      "start_ms": 24210,
      "end_ms": 26055,
      "text": "你连吃屎都赶不上热的了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28020,
      "end_ms": 28260,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00020",
      "start_ms": 28260,
      "end_ms": 28500,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00021",
      "start_ms": 30000,
      "end_ms": 30660,
      "text": "咋回事啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00022",
      "start_ms": 30660,
      "end_ms": 33380,
      "text": "经理理总那边应该是有什么事儿了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00023",
      "start_ms": 33820,
      "end_ms": 36520,
      "text": "但是又不能明说咱们走吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00024",
      "start_ms": 36520,
      "end_ms": 39940,
      "text": "随机应变这个事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00025",
      "start_ms": 39940,
      "end_ms": 41020,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00026",
      "start_ms": 41020,
      "end_ms": 41500,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00027",
      "start_ms": 41500,
      "end_ms": 43080,
      "text": "宋经理来来来赶紧做，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00028",
      "start_ms": 43240,
      "end_ms": 43680,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43880,
      "end_ms": 45460,
      "text": "人家都是千里送鹅毛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00030",
      "start_ms": 45540,
      "end_ms": 46540,
      "text": "礼轻情意重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00031",
      "start_ms": 46660,
      "end_ms": 49060,
      "text": "你这是鸡毛都不带一根就跑过来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00032",
      "start_ms": 49620,
      "end_ms": 51340,
      "text": "今天要不是看在赵总的面子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00033",
      "start_ms": 51560,
      "end_ms": 52920,
      "text": "你一口菜你都倒不上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00034",
      "start_ms": 53380,
      "end_ms": 54720,
      "text": "往后还能不能继续占？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00035",
      "start_ms": 54720,
      "end_ms": 55480,
      "text": "赵总的便宜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00036",
      "start_ms": 55720,
      "end_ms": 57545,
      "text": "可全看你今天的表现了啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00037",
      "start_ms": 57910,
      "end_ms": 58490,
      "text": "李总啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00038",
      "start_ms": 58830,
      "end_ms": 61035,
      "text": "那咱也不能奔着占赵总便宜去啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00039",
      "start_ms": 61380,
      "end_ms": 62975,
      "text": "咱得先做一个有用的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00040",
      "start_ms": 63360,
      "end_ms": 63900,
      "text": "不好意思啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00041",
      "start_ms": 63900,
      "end_ms": 64220,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00042",
      "start_ms": 64420,
      "end_ms": 65275,
      "text": "我这来迟了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00043",
      "start_ms": 65620,
      "end_ms": 66735,
      "text": "我先来个入场酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00044",
      "start_ms": 72950,
      "end_ms": 73885,
      "text": "咋不吭声了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00045",
      "start_ms": 74380,
      "end_ms": 79970,
      "text": "找我啥事儿说呀啊您上次不是给我介绍了一个好活吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00046",
      "start_ms": 80130,
      "end_ms": 80995,
      "text": "已经结束了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00047",
      "start_ms": 81290,
      "end_ms": 82570,
      "text": "我来给您汇报一下工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00048",
      "start_ms": 82850,
      "end_ms": 84415,
      "text": "要不您和赵总先谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85260,
      "end_ms": 86445,
      "text": "我看烟快抽完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87000,
      "end_ms": 88145,
      "text": "我去车里拿两包烟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00051",
      "start_ms": 88700,
      "end_ms": 89695,
      "text": "你别急歪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90240,
      "end_ms": 91240,
      "text": "有话赶紧的吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91240,
      "end_ms": 92000,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00054",
      "start_ms": 92220,
      "end_ms": 92845,
      "text": "李总啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00055",
      "start_ms": 93190,
      "end_ms": 94705,
      "text": "您能给我一个表现的机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00056",
      "start_ms": 95020,
      "end_ms": 96735,
      "text": "让我在不同的圈子里面立名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00057",
      "start_ms": 97130,
      "end_ms": 98030,
      "text": "结识不同的人脉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00058",
      "start_ms": 98110,
      "end_ms": 98935,
      "text": "我感激不尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00059",
      "start_ms": 99450,
      "end_ms": 101845,
      "text": "这次啊我把咱下次项目的备用金带来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00060",
      "start_ms": 103330,
      "end_ms": 105135,
      "text": "这下次的项目还没影呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00061",
      "start_ms": 105540,
      "end_ms": 106025,
      "text": "老弟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00062",
      "start_ms": 106710,
      "end_ms": 107985,
      "text": "你就先站住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00063",
      "start_ms": 110080,
      "end_ms": 112045,
      "text": "今人是听天命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00064",
      "start_ms": 112670,
      "end_ms": 113255,
      "text": "赵总啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00065",
      "start_ms": 113690,
      "end_ms": 115135,
      "text": "这宋经理啥都好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00066",
      "start_ms": 115520,
      "end_ms": 116815,
      "text": "就是胆小重规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00067",
      "start_ms": 117390,
      "end_ms": 118110,
      "text": "你不让他吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118350,
      "end_ms": 119175,
      "text": "他就是饿死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00069",
      "start_ms": 119400,
      "end_ms": 120655,
      "text": "都不会主动伸筷子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00070",
      "start_ms": 121190,
      "end_ms": 122195,
      "text": "咱给它夹个菜吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00071",
      "start_ms": 122680,
      "end_ms": 123515,
      "text": "宋老弟可以，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00072",
      "start_ms": 123890,
      "end_ms": 124495,
      "text": "李总先请，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00073",
      "start_ms": 126620,
      "end_ms": 126780,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00074",
      "start_ms": 126780,
      "end_ms": 127940,
      "text": "呦呦受宠若惊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00075",
      "start_ms": 127940,
      "end_ms": 128425,
      "text": "李总。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00076",
      "start_ms": 129070,
      "end_ms": 129370,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00077",
      "start_ms": 129370,
      "end_ms": 130225,
      "text": "赵总哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00078",
      "start_ms": 130650,
      "end_ms": 131205,
      "text": "赵总啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00079",
      "start_ms": 131760,
      "end_ms": 133695,
      "text": "今天这个鱼吃的怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00080",
      "start_ms": 134080,
      "end_ms": 134440,
      "text": "不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00081",
      "start_ms": 134620,
      "end_ms": 135055,
      "text": "可以，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00082",
      "start_ms": 135680,
      "end_ms": 137365,
      "text": "宋经理啊跑个腿儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00083",
      "start_ms": 137760,
      "end_ms": 138820,
      "text": "把这鱼打包一份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00084",
      "start_ms": 138820,
      "end_ms": 140415,
      "text": "送赵总车里去就在楼下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00085",
      "start_ms": 141850,
      "end_ms": 143315,
      "text": "那李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00086",
      "start_ms": 143840,
      "end_ms": 145355,
      "text": "我送完鱼就直接回去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00087",
      "start_ms": 145680,
      "end_ms": 147100,
      "text": "今天打扰两位哥哥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00088",
      "start_ms": 147100,
      "end_ms": 148285,
      "text": "雅兴海岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00089",
      "start_ms": 148650,
      "end_ms": 149290,
      "text": "下次补过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00090",
      "start_ms": 149330,
      "end_ms": 149570,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00091",
      "start_ms": 149650,
      "end_ms": 150385,
      "text": "去吧去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00092",
      "start_ms": 150710,
      "end_ms": 151095,
      "text": "经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00093",
      "start_ms": 151450,
      "end_ms": 151950,
      "text": "那个鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00094",
      "start_ms": 152070,
      "end_ms": 152865,
      "text": "我去打包吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00095",
      "start_ms": 153350,
      "end_ms": 154530,
      "text": "听不懂弦外之音呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00096",
      "start_ms": 154530,
      "end_ms": 157695,
      "text": "芳芳把后备箱内箱好酒给赵总放车上去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00097",
      "start_ms": 158400,
      "end_ms": 158895,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00098",
      "start_ms": 160660,
      "end_ms": 161175,
      "text": "经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00099",
      "start_ms": 161550,
      "end_ms": 163270,
      "text": "我还是不明白那个鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00100",
      "start_ms": 163470,
      "end_ms": 168020,
      "text": "那个鱼喂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00101",
      "start_ms": 168080,
      "end_ms": 170080,
      "text": "李总哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00102",
      "start_ms": 170340,
      "end_ms": 171485,
      "text": "明天晚上和赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00103",
      "start_ms": 171930,
      "end_ms": 172170,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00104",
      "start_ms": 172190,
      "end_ms": 172775,
      "text": "好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00105",
      "start_ms": 173080,
      "end_ms": 173835,
      "text": "感谢哥哥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00106",
      "start_ms": 174140,
      "end_ms": 175000,
      "text": "这到底咋回事啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00107",
      "start_ms": 175000,
      "end_ms": 176300,
      "text": "经理李总说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00108",
      "start_ms": 176300,
      "end_ms": 178940,
      "text": "赵总有个项目想跟我谈约我明天晚上见面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00109",
      "start_ms": 179060,
      "end_ms": 180595,
      "text": "看来今天啊是过关了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00110",
      "start_ms": 181060,
      "end_ms": 182080,
      "text": "李总真是太好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00111",
      "start_ms": 182080,
      "end_ms": 182720,
      "text": "看似粗鲁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00112",
      "start_ms": 182720,
      "end_ms": 184165,
      "text": "实则一直在帮我们说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00113",
      "start_ms": 184650,
      "end_ms": 185170,
      "text": "经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00114",
      "start_ms": 185430,
      "end_ms": 187030,
      "text": "你这样显得我很呆呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00115",
      "start_ms": 187090,
      "end_ms": 187750,
      "text": "到底咋回事啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00116",
      "start_ms": 187750,
      "end_ms": 189980,
      "text": "今天我把今天的话给你翻译，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00117",
      "start_ms": 189980,
      "end_ms": 190705,
      "text": "翻译就懂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00118",
      "start_ms": 190990,
      "end_ms": 192765,
      "text": "咱们说好的去公司找李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00119",
      "start_ms": 193050,
      "end_ms": 194850,
      "text": "再然后呢又让赶到去饭店。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00120",
      "start_ms": 194990,
      "end_ms": 196930,
      "text": "这八成啊是赵总有项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00121",
      "start_ms": 197070,
      "end_ms": 198590,
      "text": "李总给赵总推荐了咱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00122",
      "start_ms": 198730,
      "end_ms": 200450,
      "text": "但赵总啊想眼见为实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00123",
      "start_ms": 200610,
      "end_ms": 203275,
      "text": "于是啊李总临时安排了在饭店见面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00124",
      "start_ms": 203630,
      "end_ms": 205915,
      "text": "就是想让赵总看看咱是怎么表现的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00125",
      "start_ms": 206340,
      "end_ms": 206580,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00126",
      "start_ms": 207560,
      "end_ms": 209260,
      "text": "我说怎么换地方了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00127",
      "start_ms": 209440,
      "end_ms": 210075,
      "text": "然后呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00128",
      "start_ms": 210410,
      "end_ms": 211130,
      "text": "然后一见面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00129",
      "start_ms": 211130,
      "end_ms": 213970,
      "text": "李总就说鸡毛都不带一根儿就跑来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00130",
      "start_ms": 214070,
      "end_ms": 216170,
      "text": "完全不是他以前那种稳重的风格。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00131",
      "start_ms": 216330,
      "end_ms": 219990,
      "text": "对我啊更像是关系非常好的兄弟一样口无遮拦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00132",
      "start_ms": 220270,
      "end_ms": 222210,
      "text": "就是想借这种方式告诉赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00133",
      "start_ms": 222290,
      "end_ms": 223930,
      "text": "他和咱们的关系非常近。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00134",
      "start_ms": 224190,
      "end_ms": 227375,
      "text": "怪不得李总今天说话这么的鸡毛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00135",
      "start_ms": 227810,
      "end_ms": 231425,
      "text": "再然后呢再然后李总让我直接说这次项目的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00136",
      "start_ms": 231590,
      "end_ms": 233250,
      "text": "就是想让赵总看看我的表现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00137",
      "start_ms": 233610,
      "end_ms": 235085,
      "text": "而且也是想告诉赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00138",
      "start_ms": 235300,
      "end_ms": 236700,
      "text": "他自己也在跟我合作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00139",
      "start_ms": 236840,
      "end_ms": 237980,
      "text": "让赵总对我放心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00140",
      "start_ms": 238280,
      "end_ms": 241665,
      "text": "怪不得呢这按说这事儿都是私底下讲的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00141",
      "start_ms": 242160,
      "end_ms": 244720,
      "text": "再然后呢再然后啊李总我啥都好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00142",
      "start_ms": 244860,
      "end_ms": 246260,
      "text": "就是胆小重规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00143",
      "start_ms": 246340,
      "end_ms": 247460,
      "text": "别人不说让我吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00144",
      "start_ms": 247600,
      "end_ms": 249415,
      "text": "我饿死都不会主动伸筷子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00145",
      "start_ms": 249670,
      "end_ms": 251775,
      "text": "这句话的潜台词就是告诉赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00146",
      "start_ms": 252050,
      "end_ms": 252770,
      "text": "别人给了我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00147",
      "start_ms": 252770,
      "end_ms": 254290,
      "text": "就要别人不给我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00148",
      "start_ms": 254290,
      "end_ms": 255550,
      "text": "绝对不会主动伸手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00149",
      "start_ms": 255710,
      "end_ms": 257250,
      "text": "说明我是一个做事的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00150",
      "start_ms": 257250,
      "end_ms": 258345,
      "text": "不是爱钱的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00151",
      "start_ms": 258670,
      "end_ms": 258910,
      "text": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00152",
      "start_ms": 259170,
      "end_ms": 260425,
      "text": "这这么多道道啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00153",
      "start_ms": 260870,
      "end_ms": 264945,
      "text": "那那那个鱼李总给我加了一块鱼腹部的肉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00154",
      "start_ms": 265220,
      "end_ms": 266400,
      "text": "这叫推心置腹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00155",
      "start_ms": 266740,
      "end_ms": 269035,
      "text": "而且有了李总帮我做了这么多的铺垫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00156",
      "start_ms": 269320,
      "end_ms": 271140,
      "text": "赵总呢就给我加了一颗鱼眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00157",
      "start_ms": 271360,
      "end_ms": 272555,
      "text": "这叫高看一眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00158",
      "start_ms": 272880,
      "end_ms": 274340,
      "text": "所以李总最后问赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00159",
      "start_ms": 274540,
      "end_ms": 276120,
      "text": "今天这鱼吃着怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00160",
      "start_ms": 276220,
      "end_ms": 277740,
      "text": "就是想让赵总表个态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00161",
      "start_ms": 278080,
      "end_ms": 279640,
      "text": "如果赵总说不好吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00162",
      "start_ms": 279920,
      "end_ms": 281500,
      "text": "那就说明赵总的项目啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00163",
      "start_ms": 281500,
      "end_ms": 282525,
      "text": "咱们没机会了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00164",
      "start_ms": 282900,
      "end_ms": 284100,
      "text": "如果赵总说好吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00165",
      "start_ms": 284240,
      "end_ms": 289280,
      "text": "那李总啊就会借着让咱给赵总往车上送鱼的噱头表示一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00166",
      "start_ms": 289380,
      "end_ms": 291060,
      "text": "所以啊打包鱼是假的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00167",
      "start_ms": 291100,
      "end_ms": 292255,
      "text": "表示才是真的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00168",
      "start_ms": 292610,
      "end_ms": 294110,
      "text": "甲方愿意给咱机会了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00169",
      "start_ms": 294110,
      "end_ms": 295790,
      "text": "作为乙方必须要表示啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00170",
      "start_ms": 295870,
      "end_ms": 299465,
      "text": "所以我让你把我车里那箱好酒给赵总送车上去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00171",
      "start_ms": 299790,
      "end_ms": 301830,
      "text": "话能听懂又能接住事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00172",
      "start_ms": 301830,
      "end_ms": 302490,
      "text": "还能做对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00173",
      "start_ms": 302490,
      "end_ms": 303790,
      "text": "那机会自然就成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00174",
      "start_ms": 303790,
      "end_ms": 304295,
      "text": "不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00175",
      "start_ms": 304750,
      "end_ms": 305630,
      "text": "我的天哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00176",
      "start_ms": 305950,
      "end_ms": 307190,
      "text": "这么多弦外之音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00177",
      "start_ms": 307190,
      "end_ms": 308510,
      "text": "你是怎么听明白的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00178",
      "start_ms": 308510,
      "end_ms": 309810,
      "text": "经理教教我呗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00179",
      "start_ms": 309990,
      "end_ms": 311010,
      "text": "鸟欲高飞仙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00180",
      "start_ms": 311010,
      "end_ms": 311850,
      "text": "振翅人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00181",
      "start_ms": 311850,
      "end_ms": 312990,
      "text": "求上尽多读书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00182",
      "start_ms": 313210,
      "end_ms": 314530,
      "text": "我给你推荐本书吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00183",
      "start_ms": 314670,
      "end_ms": 315070,
      "text": "小芳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00184",
      "start_ms": 315350,
      "end_ms": 318610,
      "text": "就是这本我最近在反复看的这本书啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00185",
      "start_ms": 318730,
      "end_ms": 321710,
      "text": "教你在不同的场合下怎么审时度势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00186",
      "start_ms": 321890,
      "end_ms": 322490,
      "text": "会接话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00187",
      "start_ms": 322670,
      "end_ms": 323690,
      "text": "会精准表达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00188",
      "start_ms": 323970,
      "end_ms": 325970,
      "text": "掌握倾听与接话的艺术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00189",
      "start_ms": 326290,
      "end_ms": 328710,
      "text": "这里面啊包含了六十一种口才技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00190",
      "start_ms": 328970,
      "end_ms": 333450,
      "text": "每一篇都是以案例加方法的形式来教我们实用的表达术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00191",
      "start_ms": 333730,
      "end_ms": 334700,
      "text": "不仅能教会我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00192",
      "start_ms": 334700,
      "end_ms": 335960,
      "text": "我们听懂外外音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00193",
      "start_ms": 336360,
      "end_ms": 338900,
      "text": "还能教我们精准的把话说到点子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00194",
      "start_ms": 339160,
      "end_ms": 342500,
      "text": "从而啊游刃有余的应对不同的人和场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00195",
      "start_ms": 342740,
      "end_ms": 345060,
      "text": "耳才和口才都是成功的标配，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00196",
      "start_ms": 345300,
      "end_ms": 347280,
      "text": "是改善人际关系的一把利器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00197",
      "start_ms": 347500,
      "end_ms": 351180,
      "text": "尤其是跟客户、领导、老板等高水平的人对话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00198",
      "start_ms": 351540,
      "end_ms": 353700,
      "text": "一定要学会把话说到刀刃上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00199",
      "start_ms": 353940,
      "end_ms": 354880,
      "text": "唯有如此啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00200",
      "start_ms": 354880,
      "end_ms": 356680,
      "text": "才能让我们得到更多的机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00201",
      "start_ms": 356860,
      "end_ms": 358060,
      "text": "见识更多的贵人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00202",
      "start_ms": 358260,
      "end_ms": 359740,
      "text": "从而走向更高的位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00203",
      "start_ms": 359840,
      "end_ms": 361060,
      "text": "获得更高的财富。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00204",
      "start_ms": 361320,
      "end_ms": 362080,
      "text": "这些书啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00205",
      "start_ms": 362080,
      "end_ms": 363820,
      "text": "我都放在左下方链接了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8b46188e8a3e2826_s00206",
      "start_ms": 363840,
      "end_ms": 364415,
      "text": "快去拍吧。"
    }
  ],
